Package: mp3-tagger
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-mutagen, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-nautilus
Description: MP3 tag editor for Nemo and Nautilus
 Edit basic MP3 ID3 tags, lyrics and album art from the file manager.
 Supports Japanese and English through gettext.
